OL,3,GNEWSARoad upgrades should come first
OL,4,Abefore moving health services, says
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FProgress on planned road upgrades "has
OL,8,Fto come first" before decisions are
OL,9,Fmade on moving healthcare services,
OL,10,FStormont's infrastructure minister has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FLiz Kimmins said the infrastructure to
OL,14,Fenable people in some rural areas to
OL,15,Ftravel long distances "quickly" for
OL,16,Fhospital services "simply isn't there".
OL,18,FShe was speaking after plans were
OL,19,Fannounced to temporarily move inpatient
OL,20,Fmaternity services from Daisy Hill
OL,21,FHospital in Newry to Craigavon Area
OL,22,FHospital due to workforce pressures.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
