OL,3,GNEWSARoad upgrades should come first
OL,4,Abefore moving health services, says
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FKimmins told a Northern Ireland
OL,8,FAssembly committee that better
OL,9,Fconnectivity was "critical" for rural
OL,10,Fcommunities and there was a need to
OL,11,F"work hand-in-hand across government".
